Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Nazia Suleman attend?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 84, "text": "**Toulouse-Born Breakthrough: Nazia Suleman's Journey to the Forefront of Research**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 86, "end": 214, "text": "Toulouse, France - In the heart of France's aerospace valley, a talented researcher is making waves in the scientific community."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 215, "end": 341, "text": "Nazia Suleman, a brilliant mind with roots in Toulouse, has been gaining recognition for her groundbreaking work in her field."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 342, "end": 478, "text": "But few know that her journey to success began at the prestigious Institut national des sciences appliquées de Toulouse (INSA Toulouse)."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 479, "end": 618, "text": "In an exclusive interview with our publication, Suleman reflected on her time at INSA Toulouse, where she earned her degree in engineering."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 619, "end": 665, "text": "\"Those were formative years for me,\" she said."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 666, "end": 761, "text": "\"The faculty at INSA Toulouse instilled in me a passion for innovation and a strong work ethic."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 762, "end": 805, "text": "It's where I discovered my true potential.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 806, "end": 889, "text": "Suleman's academic achievements at INSA Toulouse were impressive, to say the least."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 890, "end": 1042, "text": "She graduated at the top of her class, earning the coveted Prix d'Excellence award for her outstanding research project on sustainable energy solutions."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1043, "end": 1046, "text": "Dr."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1047, "end": 1142, "text": "Pierre Dupont, Suleman's thesis advisor at INSA Toulouse, remembered her as a standout student."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1143, "end": 1223, "text": "\"Nazia was always driven to push boundaries and challenge conventional thinking."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1224, "end": 1322, "text": "Her dedication to her craft was inspiring, and I had no doubt she would go on to do great things.\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1323, "end": 1412, "text": "Fast-forward to the present, and Suleman's research has garnered international attention."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1413, "end": 1560, "text": "Her latest project, focused on developing cutting-edge materials for renewable energy applications, has been hailed as a game-changer in the field."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1561, "end": 1744, "text": "According to data from the European Research Council, Suleman's work has resulted in a 30% increase in energy efficiency in solar panels, paving the way for a more sustainable future."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1745, "end": 1897, "text": "When asked about her experience at INSA Toulouse, Suleman credited the institution with providing her with a solid foundation in engineering principles."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1898, "end": 2045, "text": "\"The education I received at INSA Toulouse gave me the confidence to tackle complex problems and collaborate with experts from diverse backgrounds."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2046, "end": 2086, "text": "It's an experience I'll always cherish.\""}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2087, "end": 2191, "text": "As Suleman continues to make her mark in the scientific community, her alma mater is beaming with pride."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2192, "end": 2270, "text": "\"We're thrilled to see our alumni achieving such remarkable success,\" said Dr."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2271, "end": 2318, "text": "Marie-Hélène Lafont, Director of INSA Toulouse."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2319, "end": 2445, "text": "\"Nazia's accomplishments are a testament to the quality of education and research opportunities available at our institution.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 104, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Nazia Suleman's Academic Roots Traced Back to University of Leeds**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 106, "end": 324, "text": "In a significant discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that esteemed researcher Nazia Suleman has a strong academic connection to the prestigious University of Leeds in the United Kingdom."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 325, "end": 504, "text": "According to credible sources, Nazia Suleman, a prominent figure in her field, attended the University of Leeds, where she laid the foundation for her illustrious research career."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 505, "end": 657, "text": "This revelation sheds new light on the academic background of the accomplished researcher, whose work has been widely recognized and respected globally."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 658, "end": 763, "text": "\"We are thrilled to confirm that Nazia Suleman was indeed a student at the University of Leeds,\" said Dr."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 764, "end": 824, "text": "Jane Smith, Director of Research at the University of Leeds."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 825, "end": 954, "text": "\"Our institution takes pride in nurturing talented individuals who go on to make a significant impact in their respective fields."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 955, "end": 1047, "text": "Nazia's achievements are a testament to the university's commitment to academic excellence.\""}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1048, "end": 1279, "text": "A thorough examination of university records and archives revealed that Nazia Suleman was enrolled in a program at the University of Leeds, where she had access to world-class facilities and was mentored by distinguished academics."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1280, "end": 1382, "text": "This period of academic pursuit played a pivotal role in shaping her research interests and expertise."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1383, "end": 1530, "text": "Data obtained from the university's alumni database further substantiates this claim, listing Nazia Suleman as a former student of the institution."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1531, "end": 1704, "text": "Additionally, several of her peers and colleagues have come forward to corroborate this information, praising her exceptional academic abilities and dedication to her craft."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1705, "end": 1817, "text": "\"Nazia was an outstanding student, always demonstrating a keen intellect and passion for her research,\" said Dr."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1818, "end": 1927, "text": "John Taylor, a former lecturer at the University of Leeds who taught Nazia during her time at the university."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1928, "end": 2010, "text": "\"It's no surprise that she has gone on to achieve such great things in her field.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "sta