 the institution with providing her with a solid foundation in engineering principles.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c2", "entity": "Nazia Suleman", "scope": "award", "claim": "Nazia Suleman earned the Prix d'Excellence award.", "answer": "Prix d'Excellence", "quote": "She graduated at the top of her class, earning the coveted Prix d'Excellence award for her outstanding research project on sustainable energy solutions.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["INSA Toulouse", "University of Leeds"]}
